 the big  dog kevin feige who of course is  brilliant so i'm expecting the best  deadpool film that we've gotten yet now  ryan reynolds has been working on the  script for a very very long time but the  deadpool team recently got new writers  for the script as well and here's where  things actually kind of get interesting  now the original writers who were  helping ryan reynolds write the script  were the malino sisters who were the  writers for bob's burgers and they did a  lot to the first edition of the script  however now there are two new writers  attached rhett reese and paul wernick  and the way they talk about the script  makes it sound like there's a lot of  really exciting things going to go down  in deadpool 3 because they talk about  how secretive the script is in an  interview with den of geek they were  asked about if they were using elements  from the previous drafts of the script  written by the molino sisters in which  they responded by saying they have an  answer but they're really not supposed  to divulge any plot details now they  said that jokingly and then they  continued to kind of joke and said they  are working in a secret vault under an  ocean somewhere implying that everything  that is going down with deadpool 3 is a  very huge secret now i've pitched before  what i think would be an amazing plot  for deadpool 3. it would be hilarious  and just have an insane amount of cameos  and i'll talk about that in just a sec  but here's where things get kind of  exciting on the forefront rhett reese  and paul wernick recently collaborated  with thor on a netflix film spider-head  so in an interview with den of geek they  asked the two writers if thor could be  making an appearance in ryan reynolds  film if we could get a deadpool and thor  interaction and here's what they  responded with rhys said that it would  be super cool but if he did they  certainly couldn't talk about it now of  course this is in no way a confirmation  that thor is going to be in deadpool 3.  however i do think that we are going to  get an insane amount of cameos in  deadpool 3 because i think deadpool 3 is  going to be a story about how he goes  from the fox universe to the mcu you  almost have to go this route with a  character like deadpool because he is so  aware of the actual reality of the  movies deadpool breaks the fourth wall  that's one of the most exciting things  about deadpool he can address what the  audience is actually thinking he doesn't  just live inside of the boundaries of  the film and we know that he's going to  be in the mcu but he's gotta get out of  the fox universe first and the way i  hope he does that and i've mentioned  this before is i hope they do a deadpool  kills the fox universe storyline to  where he just completely kills every  single person in the fox universe and  makes it to where they can all now be in  the mcu obviously it would be their  variance and he would address this in a  fourth wall breaking type of way but i  think it would be really really funny if  that's how he actually got to the mcu  and kind of wanted to keep the mcu2  himself that's why he would kill  everybody else now if you're wondering  about deadpool being rated r over at  marvel studios and disney i understand  your concern it was my concern as well  that disney would not allow deadpool to  remain rated r however it appears we  have absolutely nothing to worry about  in that same interview with den of geek  the writers were asked if disney was  going to kind of make them behave and  play pg-13 or would they be allowed to  remain rated r in which they replied  that the studio has actually been very  supportive of the characters rated r  requirements they said in the interview  they've been very supportive with regard  to that now when it comes to a  particular joke if we cross a line maybe  we'll hear at some point maybe not that  joke but i think they've been incredibly  supportive of what we're doing because  obviously we were doing it separate from  them for a long time and i think they've  seen the success and they've had their  own even greater success so hopefully  it'll be a marriage made in heaven but  we've definitely got their support and  that's a great thing to feel so it looks  like deadpool is in fact remaining rated  r and this is coming directly from the  writers themselves however it does look  like kevin feige does have a line and he  might make them rewrite some of the  jokes that they have but if there's  anybody that i have confidence in it's  kevin feige now as far as some guardians  of the galaxy 3 news we have a new cast  member deadline has reported an  exclusive that oscar nominee maria  bakalova has joined the cast of  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 in a key  role now unfortunately they did not  reveal what role this is going to be  however like i mentioned in true james  gunn fashion he went to twitter and did  confirm that she is in fact part of the  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 cast he  replied to deadline's tweet saying yes  yes yes okay i guess i should be  surprised it took you guys this long to  get this one maria baklava is incredible  hashtag guardians of the galaxy vol 3.  so now of course the question is who is  she going to be playing and let's dive  into a little bit about what we know so  far about guardians 3 and if you're  trying to avoid any type of spoilers for  guardians 3 here's your warning although  they're not particularly huge but we  will be talking about the villain the  villain is pretty much confirmed to be  the high evolutionary we have speculated  about this for a while and then some  photos got released from the paparazzi  that showed a bunch of animal alien  looking people and what these are are  experiments done on animals to make them  kind of humanoid by the high  evolutionary that's exactly what the  high evolutionary does in fact he is the  one who created rocket raccoon and it's  widely believed that these evolved  animals